<![CDATA[<div><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Lead.FirstName},</font><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">As promised, here is contact info for one of best lenders. Your next step is to complete the online application for financing. Once you are pre-approved, we will be ready to start building your portfolio together.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><b><br><a href="http://rsansonetti.blueleaflending.com/"><font color="#3366ff">Please use the link included in Nina Harrison's contact info</font></a>&nbsp;</b>below and complete the application. Nina's team will reach out to you within 48 hours of receiving your application to introduce themselves and help you obtain the financing approval.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div>Let me know as soon as you receive your approval for financing, and schedule a call with me using the link in my email as soon you are approved so that we can begin review properties as the become available.</div><div><br></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Thanks,</span></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Marq</font></div></div></div><div><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;<u></u></p><table class="m_-162439093095705746m_12784374252237045MsoNormalTable" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="334" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); width: 250.5pt;"><tbody><tr style="height: 14.25pt;"><td colspan="6" style="margin: 0px; background: rgb(226, 35, 26); padding: 0in; height: 14.25pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 14.72px;"><span style="font-size: 13.5pt; line-height: 20.7px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: